---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — ErgoSetupHub">
  <main class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>About ErgoSetupHub</h1>
      <p>
        ErgoSetupHub is a small, independent site focused on one thing: helping people set up a home office that
        doesn't leave them sore at the end of the day. We cover chairs, desks, monitor arms, keyboards, mice and
        lighting, the handful of things that make the biggest difference to how a workspace actually feels to use.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're not a large publication with a testing lab. We research products carefully, favor well-reviewed items
        with a clear ergonomic rationale, and link out to Amazon so you can see current pricing, sizes and colors for
        yourself.
      </p>
      <h2>How the site makes money</h2>
      <p>
        ErgoSetupHub is a participant in the Amazon Associates program. When you click through to Amazon from one of
        our links and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a small commission, at no extra cost to you. See our
        <a href="/disclosure.html">full disclosure</a> for details.
      </p>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Have a suggestion for a product we should cover, or spotted something that needs fixing on the site? Reach out
        via the contact details on our disclosure page.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="back"><a href="/">&larr; Back to home</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
